          "expr": "(100 * ((sum(rate(support_http_requests_total{job=\"support-desk\",namespace=\"support-desk\",pod=~\"$pod\",status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or (0 * (sum(rate(support_http_requests_total{job=\"support-desk\",namespace=\"support-desk\",pod=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval]))))) / (sum(rate(support_http_requests_total{job=\"support-desk\",namespace=\"support-desk\",pod=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval])))) and on() ((sum(rate(support_http_requests_total{job=\"support-desk\",namespace=\"support-desk\",pod=~\"$pod\"}[$__rate_interval]))) > 0)",
