      "description": "Existing week-5 SLA: percentage of good 15s intervals in 30m. Requires all business SLOs, synthetic p95 <1s, fresh successful probes and scraping health. Target ≥99%. Independent of the application Pod filter. Read together with coverage.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "No data",
